  "description": "Start your everyday life in a sporty way with the Sneak Plus EQ Shift HighStep, the lightweight urban e-bike with a minimalist design and full EQ equipment. It is designed for commutes, errands, shopping and quick city rides – even in changing weather conditions. The Sneak Plus EQ Shift HighStep is a lightweight urban e-bike for sporty and everyday mobility in city traffic. The Mahle X30 hub motor with three assistance modes and a 250 Wh battery supports you on commutes, for appointments and on quick city rides. Mudguards, a luggage rack, an AXA folding lock, a centre stand and a lighting system make the 17.1 kg* lightweight bike ready for shopping and daily journeys even in changing weather conditions. The Sneak Plus EQ Shift HighStep combines a Mahle X30 hub motor with 45 Nm of torque, an integrated 250 Wh battery and three selectable assistance modes with a weight of approximately 17 kg*. The electric assistance makes riding in city traffic easier, while the luggage rack, AXA folding lock, centre stand and lighting system support daily use. This makes the urban e-bike suitable for commutes, shopping and sporty rides through the city. • Low weight for easy, agile riding • Light motor assistance for quick journeys through the city • Minimalist design for a clean look Ideal for • Commutes to work, education or daily appointments • Errands and shopping in city traffic • Sporty rides and quick rides around town on paved paths • Everyday mobility in changing weather conditions • Riders looking for a lightweight urban e-bike with everyday Equipment Less suitable for • Bikepacking and transporting heavy loads • Long weekend tours and rides in the mountains • Unpaved terrain and steep climbs Further Equipment The Sneak Plus EQ Shift HighStep is equipped with 40-622 Schwalbe Super Moto tyres on Rose wheels. The Ergon SF20 saddle and Ergon GA30 grips complement the upright, urban equipment. Shimano disc brakes ensure controlled deceleration in city traffic – even in changing weather conditions. The Rose Sneak Plus EQ Shift HighStep is supplied fully equipped – including pedals, mudguards, luggage rack, lighting and folding lock. Included equipment: • 1 Rose Sneak Plus EQ Shift HighStep • 1 AXA Fold 100 folding lock • 1 mudguard for front wheel • 1 mudguard for rear wheel • 1 luggage rack • 1 Widek aluminium bell • 2 ROSE VP-836 pedals • 2 brake pad spacers for disc brake Additional accessories such as panniers or a range extender are not included. approx. 17.2 kg, may vary up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for frame colour Thyme, size M, without pedals.",
